# Ad-hoc empirical capture traces (e.g. PTY output, parser probes). These
# are written by scripts/verify-*.js / scripts/capture-*.js / scripts/probe-*.js
# for local bug-reproduction work and are not checked in. Probe reports carry
# machine-specific paths, so they must never enter this public repo.
/debug-traces/
*-probe-report.md
.opencode/plugins/kangentic-activity.mjs
